<span id="S3.T1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Representative <span id="S3.T1.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Modes</span> and Attributes</span></span>
